{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233690","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233690","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1423369001:1":{"text":"你们来了！谢谢你们愿意来听我的第一课。","source_cn":"你们来了！谢谢你们愿意来听我的第一课。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58CAC6AFC66FB8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423369002:1":{"text":"欧罗娜，我们看到许多孩子也已经来了，看来你很受孩子们欢迎嘛！","source_cn":"欧罗娜，我们看到许多孩子也已经来了，看来你很受孩子们欢迎嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF872CEB028BA9B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423369003:1":{"text":"这要多谢你们在沙利叶大人面前提起这件事。一开始我跟这里的大人和孩子说要开课教学，他们都不太信任我……","source_cn":"这要多谢你们在沙利叶大人面前提起这件事。一开始我跟这里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0332F1196C81763F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423369004:1":{"text":"后来，沙利叶大人给我送来了许多书本纸笔，还说要在这里建一所学校，大家才对我有了信心。","source_cn":"后来，沙利叶大人给我送来了许多书本纸笔，还说要在这里建...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x572BF2BBA39DEECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1423369004":{"text":"后来，沙利叶大人给我送来了许多书本纸笔，还说要在这里建一所学校，大家才对我有了信心。","source_cn":"后来，沙利叶大人给我送来了许多书本纸笔，还说要在这里建一所学校，大家才对我有了信心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x572BF2BBA39DEECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_ind