课吗？","source_cn":"要怎么办？孩子们都在等着……要现在开始上课吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478B23285A40C9D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423369011:1":{"text":"哪怕少了一个孩子，我的课堂都是不完整的，不应该这样草率地开始。","source_cn":"哪怕少了一个孩子，我的课堂都是不完整的，不应该这样草率...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C03526354596A3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423369012:1":{"text":"詹米，你知道希娜现在可能在哪里吗？","source_cn":"詹米，你知道希娜现在可能在哪里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA51D6CACDF7042F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423369013:1":{"text":"我不知道，希娜最近没有跟我玩……但希娜跟朱尔玩了，朱尔肯定知道！","source_cn":"我不知道，希娜最近没有跟我玩……但希娜跟朱尔玩了，朱尔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB77AFCF5DF2C0A29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423369014:1":{"text":"我们去找朱尔问问吧。","source_cn":"我们去找朱尔问问吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ADD34CB1BDB8BEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"这要感谢你的选择","source_cn":"这要感谢你的选择","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD9885296F23468","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","m